hadiths[128]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne samandar ke bare mein farmaya: 'Us ka pani pak karne wala hai aur us ka murdar halal hai.' Ise Arba'a ne aur Ibn Abi Shaibah ne riwayat kiya aur alfaz Ibn Abi Shaibah ke hain; Ibn Khuzaimah (Rahimahullah) aur Tirmidhi (Rahimahullah) ne ise sahih kaha; aur ise Malik (Rahimahullah), Shafi'i (Rahimahullah) aur Ahmad (Rahimahullah) ne bhi riwayat kiya."
"2","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Pani pak hai, use koi cheez napak nahin karti.' Ise Salasa ne riwayat kiya aur Ahmad (Rahimahullah) ne ise sahih kaha."
"3","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Umamah Bahili (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Pani ko koi cheez napak nahin karti siwae us cheez ke jo us ki bu, us ke zaeqe aur us ke rang par ghalib aa jae.' Ise Ibn Majah ne riwayat kiya aur Abu Hatim (Rahimahullah) ne ise za'if kaha; aur Baihaqi (Rahimahullah) ke alfaz hain: 'Pani pak hai siwae is ke ke us ki bu ya zaeqa ya rang kisi paida hone wali najasat se badal jae.'"
"4","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab pani do qulle [do bade matke] ho to woh gandagi ko qabool nahin karta [napak nahin hota].' Aur ek lafz mein hai: 'Woh napak nahin hota.' Ise Arba'a ne riwayat kiya aur Ibn Khuzaimah (Rahimahullah), Ibn Hibban (Rahimahullah) aur Hakim (Rahimahullah) ne ise sahih kaha."
"5","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Tum mein se koi thehre hue pani mein ghusl na kare jabke woh junubi ho.' Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya; aur Bukhari ke alfaz hain: 'Tum mein se koi thehre hue pani mein jo behta na ho peshab na kare, phir us mein ghusl kare'; aur Muslim ke alfaz mein 'us mein se' ka izafa hai; aur Abu Dawud ke alfaz hain: 'Aur woh us mein janabat se ghusl na kare.'"
"6","[AI-translation] Us shakhs se riwayat hai jo Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki suhbat mein raha, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mana farmaya ke aurat mard ke bache hue pani se ghusl kare ya mard aurat ke bache hue pani se, aur dono mil kar [ek hi bartan se] pani lein. Ise Abu Dawud aur Nasai ne riwayat kiya aur is ki sanad sahih hai."
"7","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Hazrat Maimunah (Raziyallahu anha) ke bache hue pani se ghusl farmate the. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya; aur Sunan walon ke han hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki kisi zauja ne ek lagan mein ghusl kiya, phir Aap us mein se ghusl karne lage to unhon ne kaha: Main junubi thi? To Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Pani junubi nahin hota [pani napak nahin hota].' Ise Tirmidhi (Rahimahullah) aur Ibn Khuzaimah (Rahimahullah) ne sahih kaha."
"8","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Tum mein se kisi ke bartan ki taharat jab us mein kutta munh dal de yeh hai ke use saat martaba dhoe, jin mein pehli martaba mitti se ho.' Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya; aur unhi ke ek lafz mein hai: 'To use baha de'; aur Tirmidhi ke han hai: 'Un mein aakhri ya pehli mitti se ho.'"
"9","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Qatadah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne billi ke bare mein farmaya: 'Woh napak nahin hai, woh to tum par aane jane walon mein se hai [ghar mein phirti rehti hai].' Ise Arba'a ne riwayat kiya aur Tirmidhi (Rahimahullah) aur Ibn Khuzaimah (Rahimahullah) ne ise sahih kaha."
"10","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ek dehati aaya aur masjid ke ek kinare mein peshab karne laga, to logon ne use jhidka, magar Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen mana farmaya; phir jab woh peshab se farigh ho gaya to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne pani ka ek dol mangwaya jo us par baha diya gaya. Muttafaq alaih [Bukhari wa Muslim]."
"11","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Hamare liye do murdar aur do khoon halal kiye gaye; murdar do hain: tiddi aur machhli; aur khoon do hain: tilli aur kaleji.' Ise Ahmad aur Ibn Majah ne riwayat kiya aur is mein za'f hai."
"12","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab tum mein se kisi ke mashroob mein makkhi gir jae to use dubo de, phir nikal de, kyunke us ke ek par mein beemari hai aur doosre mein shifa hai.' Ise Bukhari aur Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya, aur Abu Dawud ne izafa kiya: 'Aur woh apne us par se bachta hai jis mein beemari hai [usi par ko mashroob mein pahle dalta hai].'"
"13","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Waqid Laisi (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo hissa zinda janwar se kaat liya jae woh murdar hai.' Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya, Tirmidhi ne ise hasan kaha aur alfaz unhi ke hain."
"14","[AI-translation] Hazrat Huzaifah bin Yaman (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Sone chandi ke bartanon mein na piyo aur na un ki thalion mein khao, kyunke woh un [kafiron] ke liye duniya mein hain aur tumhare liye aakhirat mein hain.' Muttafaq alaih."
"15","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Salamah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo shakhs chandi ke bartan mein peeta hai woh apne pet mein jahannam ki aag hi ghatahta [daalta] hai.' Muttafaq alaih."
"16","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab khal ko dabaghat de di jae to woh pak ho jati hai.' Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya; aur Arba'a ke han hai: 'Jo bhi khal dabaghat di jae [woh pak ho jati hai].'"
"17","[AI-translation] Hazrat Salamah bin Muhabbiq (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Murdar ki khalon ki dabaghat un ki taharat hai.' Ise Ibn Hibban (Rahimahullah) ne sahih kaha."
"18","[AI-translation] Hazrat Maimunah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ek bakri ke paas se guzre jise log ghaseet rahe the, to Aap ne farmaya: 'Tum ne us ki khal kyun na le li?' Unhon ne kaha: Woh murdar hai. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Use pani aur qarz [dabaghat ke patte] pak kar dete.' Ise Abu Dawud aur Nasai ne riwayat kiya."
"19","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'labah Khushani (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Ham Ahle Kitab qaum ki zameen mein hain, kya ham un ke bartanon mein khaen? Aap ne farmaya: 'Un mein na khao siwae is ke ke tumhen us ke siwa kuch na mile, to unhen dho lo aur un mein khao.' Muttafaq alaih."
"20","[AI-translation] Hazrat Imran bin Husain (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aur Aap ke sahaba ne ek mushrik aurat ki mashk se wuzu kiya. Muttafaq alaih, ek taweel hadees mein."
"21","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka pyala toot gaya to Aap ne darad ki jagah chandi ka taar lagwa liya. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya."
"22","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se sharab ke bare mein poocha gaya ke use sirka banaya jae? Aap ne farmaya: 'Nahin.' Ise Muslim aur Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya aur Tirmidhi ne kaha ke yeh hadees hasan sahih hai."
"23","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke jab Khaibar ka din aaya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Hazrat Abu Talhah (Raziyallahu anhu) ko hukm diya to unhon ne elan kiya: 'Beshak Allah aur Us ke Rasool tumhen gadhon [gharailu gadhon] ke gosht se mana karte hain, kyunke woh napak hai.' Muttafaq alaih."
"24","[AI-translation] Hazrat Amr bin Kharijah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Mina mein hamen khutba diya jabke Aap apni sawari par the aur us ki raal mere kandhon par beh rahi thi. Ise Ahmad aur Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya aur Tirmidhi ne ise sahih kaha."
"25","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mani ko dho dete, phir usi kapde mein namaz ke liye nikalte jabke main us mein dhone ka nishan dekh rahi hoti. Muttafaq alaih; aur Muslim ke han hai: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke kapde se use khurach kar ragad deti thi, phir Aap us mein namaz padhte; aur unhi ke ek lafz mein hai: Main use khushk hone par apne nakhun se khurachti thi."
"26","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Samh (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Ladki ke peshab se dhoya jae aur ladke ke peshab par pani chhidka jae.' Ise Abu Dawud aur Nasai ne riwayat kiya aur Hakim (Rahimahullah) ne ise sahih kaha."
"27","[AI-translation] Hazrat Asma bint Abi Bakr (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne haiz ke khoon ke bare mein farmaya jo kapde ko lag jae: 'Use khurache, phir pani se mal kar ragde, phir pani chhidke, phir us mein namaz padhe.' Muttafaq alaih."
"28","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Khaulah ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Phir agar khoon na jae? Aap ne farmaya: 'Tumhen pani kafi hai aur us ka nishan tumhen nuqsan nahin dega.' Ise Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya aur is ki sanad za'if hai."
"29","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Agar meri ummat par mashaqqat ka khauf na hota to main unhen har wuzu ke sath miswak ka hukm deta.' Ise Malik, Ahmad aur Nasai ne riwayat kiya aur Ibn Khuzaimah (Rahimahullah) ne ise sahih kaha; aur Bukhari ne ise ta'liqan zikr kiya."
"30","[AI-translation] Humran se riwayat hai ke Hazrat Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) ne wuzu ka pani mangwaya, to dono hath teen martaba dhoe, phir kulli ki, naak mein pani dala aur jhada, phir chehra teen martaba dhoya, phir dayan hath kuhni tak teen martaba dhoya, phir bayan isi tarah, phir sar ka masah kiya, phir dayan paon takhnon tak teen martaba dhoya, phir bayan isi tarah, phir kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko apne is wuzu ki tarah wuzu karte dekha. Muttafaq alaih."
"31","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke wuzu ki sifat mein riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Aur Aap ne ek martaba sar ka masah kiya. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya, aur Nasai aur Tirmidhi ne ise sahih sanad se riwayat kiya, balke Tirmidhi ne kaha ke yeh is bab mein sab se sahih cheez hai."
"32","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Zaid bin Asim (Raziyallahu anhu) se wuzu ki sifat mein riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Aur Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne sar ka masah kiya, apne dono hathon ko aage lae aur peeche le gaye. Muttafaq alaih; aur ek lafz mein hai: Aap ne sar ke agle hisse se shuru kiya yahan tak ke dono hathon ko gudi tak le gaye, phir unhen usi jagah wapas lae jahan se shuru kiya tha."
"33","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziyallahu anhuma) se wuzu ki sifat mein riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Phir Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne sar ka masah kiya aur apni shahadat ki unglion ko kanon mein dakhil kiya aur anguthon se kanon ke bahar ka masah kiya. Ise Abu Dawud aur Nasai ne riwayat kiya aur Ibn Khuzaimah (Rahimahullah) ne ise sahih kaha."
"34","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab tum mein se koi apni neend se jage to teen martaba naak jhade, kyunke shaitan us ki naak ke bansay par raat guzarta hai.' Muttafaq alaih."
"35","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai: 'Jab tum mein se koi apni neend se jage to apna hath bartan mein na duboe yahan tak ke use teen martaba dho le, kyunke woh nahin janta ke us ka hath kahan raha.' Muttafaq alaih, aur yeh alfaz Muslim ke hain."
"36","[AI-translation] Hazrat Laqit bin Sabirah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Wuzu poora karo, unglion ka khilal karo aur naak mein pani chadhane mein mubalagha karo siwae is ke ke tum rozedar ho.' Ise Arba'a ne riwayat kiya aur Ibn Khuzaimah (Rahimahullah) ne ise sahih kaha; aur Abu Dawud ki ek riwayat mein hai: 'Jab tum wuzu karo to kulli karo.'"
"37","[AI-translation] Hazrat Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) wuzu mein apni dadhi ka khilal farmate the. Ise Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya aur Ibn Khuzaimah (Rahimahullah) ne ise sahih kaha."
"38","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Zaid (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas do tahai mudd [pani] laya gaya to Aap apni kalaiyon ko malne lage. Ise Ahmad ne riwayat kiya aur Ibn Khuzaimah (Rahimahullah) ne ise sahih kaha."
"39","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekha ke Aap apne kanon ke liye us pani ke siwa alag pani lete jo sar ke liye liya tha. Ise Baihaqi ne riwayat kiya; aur yeh Muslim ke han isi wajh se is lafz se hai: Aur Aap ne apne sar ka masah us pani se kiya jo hathon ke bache hue pani ke siwa tha, aur yahi mahfooz hai."
"40","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Meri ummat qayamat ke din is haal mein aaegi ke wuzu ke asar se un ke chehre aur hath paon chamak rahe honge, to jo tum mein se apni chamak badha sakta hai woh badhae.' Muttafaq alaih, aur alfaz Muslim ke hain."
"41","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko joota pahanne, kanghi karne, taharat mein aur apne har kaam mein dayan taraf se shuru karna pasand tha. Muttafaq alaih."
"42","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab tum wuzu karo to apni dayan taraf se shuru karo.' Ise Arba'a ne riwayat kiya aur Ibn Khuzaimah (Rahimahullah) ne ise sahih kaha."
"43","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mughirah bin Shu'bah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne wuzu kiya to Aap ne apni peshani aur amame aur mouzon par masah kiya. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"44","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke hajj ki sifat mein riwayat hai ke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Us cheez se shuru karo jis se Allah ne shuru kiya.' Ise Nasai ne isi tarah amr ke seeghe se riwayat kiya, jabke Muslim ke han yeh khabar ke seeghe se hai."
"45","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab wuzu farmate to kuhnion par pani pherte. Ise Daraqutni ne za'if sanad se riwayat kiya."
"46","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Us ka wuzu nahin jis ne us par Allah ka naam na liya.' Ise Ahmad, Abu Dawud aur Ibn Majah ne za'if sanad se riwayat kiya; aur Tirmidhi ke han Sa'id bin Zaid aur Abu Sa'id se isi tarah hai. Ahmad (Rahimahullah) ne kaha: Is mein koi cheez sabit nahin."
"47","[AI-translation] Hazrat Talhah bin Musarrif se, woh apne walid se, woh apne dada se riwayat karte hain ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko kulli aur naak mein pani dalne ke darmiyan fasl karte dekha. Ise Abu Dawud ne za'if sanad se riwayat kiya."
"48","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se wuzu ki sifat mein riwayat hai ke phir Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne kulli ki aur teen martaba naak jhadi, usi chullu se kulli karte aur naak jhadte jis se pani lete. Ise Abu Dawud aur Nasai ne riwayat kiya."
"49","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Zaid (Raziyallahu anhu) se wuzu ki sifat mein riwayat hai ke phir Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apna hath dakhil kiya, to ek hi chullu se kulli ki aur naak mein pani dala, aisa teen martaba karte. Muttafaq alaih."
"50","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek aadmi ko dekha aur us ke qadam mein nakhun ke barabar jagah thi jise pani nahin pahuncha tha. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Wapas jao aur apna wuzu achchi tarah karo.' Ise Abu Dawud aur Nasai ne riwayat kiya."
"51","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ek mudd se wuzu farmate aur ek sa' se paanch amdad tak ghusl farmate. Muttafaq alaih."
"52","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Tum mein se jo bhi wuzu kare aur wuzu poora kare, phir kahe: Main gawahi deta hun ke Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin, Woh akela hai, Us ka koi shareek nahin, aur main gawahi deta hun ke Muhammad Us ke bande aur Us ke Rasool hain, to us ke liye jannat ke darwaze khol diye jate hain.' Ise Muslim aur Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya, aur Tirmidhi ne izafa kiya: 'Aey Allah! Mujhe tauba karne walon mein se bana aur mujhe pak rehne walon mein se bana.'"
"53","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mughirah bin Shu'bah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath tha, to Aap ne wuzu kiya, main Aap ke mouze utarne ke liye jhuka to Aap ne farmaya: 'Inhen chhor do, kyunke main ne inhen taharat ki haalat mein pahna tha,' phir Aap ne un par masah kiya. Muttafaq alaih."
"54","[AI-translation] Aur Arba'a ke han Nasaai ke siwa unhi se hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mouze ke upar aur neeche masah kiya; aur is ki sanad mein za'f hai."
"55","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Agar deen rae se hota to mouze ka neeche ka hissa masah ka us ke upar se ziyada haqdar hota, aur main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko apne mouzon ke zahir par masah karte dekha hai. Ise Abu Dawud ne hasan sanad se riwayat kiya."
"56","[AI-translation] Hazrat Safwan bin Assal (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamen hukm dete jab ham safar mein hote ke apne mouze teen din aur un ki raaten na utaren siwae janabat se, lekin pakhane, peshab aur neend se [masah karen]. Ise Nasai aur Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya aur alfaz Tirmidhi ke hain, aur Ibn Khuzaimah (Rahimahullah) ne ise sahih kaha."
"57","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali bin Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne musafir ke liye teen din aur un ki raaten aur muqeem ke liye ek din aur ek raat muqarrar farmayi, yani mouzon par masah mein. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"58","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sauban (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek dasta bheja aur unhen hukm diya ke asaaib [yani amamon] aur tasakheen [yani mouzon] par masah karen. Ise Ahmad aur Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya aur Hakim (Rahimahullah) ne ise sahih kaha."
"59","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar se mauqoofan aur Hazrat Anas se marfoo'an riwayat hai: 'Jab tum mein se koi wuzu kare aur apne mouze pahne to un par masah kare aur un mein namaz padhe aur unhen na utare agar chahe siwae janabat se.' Ise Daraqutni aur Hakim ne riwayat kiya aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"60","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Bakrah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne musafir ke liye teen din aur un ki raaten aur muqeem ke liye ek din aur ek raat ki ruksat di jab woh taharat karke apne mouze pahne ke un par masah kare. Ise Daraqutni ne riwayat kiya aur Ibn Khuzaimah (Rahimahullah) ne ise sahih kaha."
"61","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ubayy bin Imarah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya main mouzon par masah karun? Aap ne farmaya: 'Han.' Unhon ne kaha: Ek din? Aap ne farmaya: 'Han.' Unhon ne kaha: Aur do din? Aap ne farmaya: 'Han.' Unhon ne kaha: Aur teen? Aap ne farmaya: 'Han, aur jitna chaho.' Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya aur kaha: Yeh qawi nahin hai."
"62","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba Aap ke zamane mein isha ka intezar karte yahan tak ke un ke sar jhuk jate [unghne lagte], phir namaz padhte aur wuzu na karte. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya aur Daraqutni ne ise sahih kaha; aur is ki asl Muslim mein hai."
"63","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Fatimah bint Abi Hubaish Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aain aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Main ek aisi aurat hun jise istihaza aata hai aur main pak nahin hoti, kya main namaz chhor dun? Aap ne farmaya: 'Nahin, yeh to ek rag hai aur haiz nahin hai, to jab tumhara haiz aae to namaz chhor do aur jab woh khatm ho to apne se khoon dho lo, phir namaz padho.' Muttafaq alaih; aur Bukhari ke han hai: 'Phir har namaz ke liye wuzu karo.' Aur Muslim ne ishara kiya ke unhon ne ise amdan hazaf kiya."
"64","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali bin Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke main mazi bahut aane wala aadmi tha, to main ne Miqdad bin Aswad ko hukm diya ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poochen, to unhon ne poocha? To Aap ne farmaya: 'Is mein wuzu hai.' Muttafaq alaih, aur alfaz Bukhari ke hain."
"65","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apni kisi biwi ka bosa liya, phir namaz ke liye nikle aur wuzu na kiya. Ise Ahmad ne riwayat kiya aur Bukhari ne ise za'if kaha."
"66","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab tum mein se koi apne pet mein kuch pae aur use shak ho ke us se kuch nikla ya nahin, to masjid se na nikle yahan tak ke awaz sune ya bu pae.' Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"67","[AI-translation] Hazrat Talq bin Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi ne kaha: Main ne apni sharmgah ko chhua, ya kaha: Aadmi namaz mein apni sharmgah ko chhue to kya us par wuzu hai? To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Nahin, woh to tumhara ek tukda hai.' Ise Khamsa ne riwayat kiya aur Ibn Hibban (Rahimahullah) ne ise sahih kaha; aur Ibn Madini ne kaha: Yeh Busrah ki hadees se behtar hai."
"68","[AI-translation] Hazrat Busrah bint Safwan (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo apni sharmgah ko chhue woh wuzu kare.' Ise Khamsa ne riwayat kiya aur Tirmidhi aur Ibn Hibban ne ise sahih kaha; aur Bukhari ne kaha: Yeh is bab mein sab se sahih cheez hai."
"69","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jise qai ya nakseer ya qalas [khatti dakkar se munh mein aane wala pani] ya mazi aa jae woh wapas jae aur wuzu kare, phir apni namaz par bina kare, jabke woh is dauran baat na kare.' Ise Ibn Majah ne riwayat kiya aur Ahmad aur ghair ne ise za'if kaha."
"70","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Samurah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha: Kya main bakri ke gosht se wuzu karun? Aap ne farmaya: 'Agar chaho.' Us ne kaha: Kya main unt ke gosht se wuzu karun? Aap ne farmaya: 'Han.' Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"71","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo maiyyat ko ghusl de woh ghusl kare aur jo use uthae woh wuzu kare.' Ise Ahmad, Nasai aur Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya aur Tirmidhi ne ise hasan kaha; aur Ahmad ne kaha: Is bab mein koi cheez sahih nahin."
"72","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Abi Bakr (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke us kitab mein jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Amr bin Hazm ke liye likhi thi [tha]: 'Quran ko siwae tahir ke koi na chhue.' Ise Malik ne mursal riwayat kiya, aur Nasai aur Ibn Hibban ne ise mausul kiya, aur yeh ma'lul hai."
"73","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) har haal mein Allah ka zikr farmate the. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya aur Bukhari ne ise ta'liqan zikr kiya."
"74","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne pichhne lagwae aur namaz padhi aur wuzu na kiya. Ise Daraqutni ne riwayat kiya aur use layyin [kamzor] kaha."
"75","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mu'awiyah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Aankh dubur ka bandhan hai, to jab dono aankhen so jati hain to bandhan khul jata hai.' Ise Ahmad aur Tabarani ne riwayat kiya aur izafa kiya: 'Aur jo soe woh wuzu kare.' Aur yeh izafa is hadees mein Abu Dawud ke han Hazrat Ali ki hadees se hai us qaul ke baghair: 'Bandhan khul jata hai.' Aur dono sanadon mein za'f hai. Aur Abu Dawud ke han Ibn Abbas se marfoo'an bhi hai: 'Wuzu sirf us par hai jo let kar soe.' Aur is ki sanad mein bhi za'f hai."
"76","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Tum mein se kisi ke paas shaitan us ki namaz mein aata hai aur us ki dubur mein phoonk marta hai to use khayal hota hai ke us ne hadas kiya halanke us ne hadas nahin kiya, to jab woh aisa pae to na phire yahan tak ke awaz sune ya bu pae.' Ise Bazzar ne riwayat kiya; aur is ki asl Sahihain mein Abdullah bin Zaid ki hadees se hai; aur Muslim ke han Abu Hurairah se isi tarah hai; aur Hakim ke han Abu Sa'id se marfoo'an hai: 'Jab tum mein se kisi ke paas shaitan aae aur kahe: Tum ne hadas kiya, to woh kahe: Tum ne jhoot kaha.' Aur ise Ibn Hibban ne is lafz se riwayat kiya: 'To woh apne dil mein kahe.'"
"77","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab baitul-khala mein dakhil hote to apni anguthi utar dete. Ise Arba'a ne riwayat kiya aur yeh ma'lul hai."
"78","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab baitul-khala mein dakhil hote to farmate: 'Aey Allah! Main khabees jinon aur khabees jinnion se Teri panah mangta hun.' Ise Sab'a ne riwayat kiya."
"79","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) baitul-khala mein dakhil hote to main aur mere jaisa ek ladka pani ka lota aur neza uthate, phir Aap pani se istinja farmate. Muttafaq alaih."
"80","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mughirah bin Shu'bah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: 'Lota lo.' Phir Aap itni door gae ke mujh se ojhal ho gae, phir hajat poori ki. Muttafaq alaih."
"81","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Do la'nat wali jaghon se bacho: jo logon ke raste mein ya un ke sae mein qazae hajat kare.' Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya; Abu Dawud ne Mu'az se izafa kiya: 'Aur ghaton par'; aur Ahmad ke han Ibn Abbas se hai: 'Ya thehre hue pani par.' Aur in donon mein za'f hai. Aur Tabarani ne phal-dar darakhton ke neeche aur behti nadi ke kinare ki mumaniat nikali hai Ibn Umar ki hadees se za'if sanad ke sath."
"82","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab do aadmi pakhana karen to un mein se har ek apne sathi se ojhal ho jae aur baat na karen, kyunke Allah is par naraz hota hai.' Ise riwayat kiya gaya; aur Ibn Sakan aur Ibn Qattan ne ise sahih kaha, magar yeh ma'lul hai."
"83","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Qatadah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Tum mein se koi peshab karte waqt apni sharmgah ko dayen hath se na pakde, aur baitul-khala se dayen hath se safai na kare, aur bartan mein saans na le.' Muttafaq alaih, aur alfaz Muslim ke hain."
"84","[AI-translation] Hazrat Salman (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke hamen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mana farmaya ke ham pakhane ya peshab ke waqt qible ki taraf munh karen, ya dayen hath se istinja karen, ya teen pathron se kam se istinja karen, ya gobar ya haddi se istinja karen. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"85","[AI-translation] Aur Sab'a ke han Hazrat Abu Ayyub (Raziyallahu anhu) ki hadees se hai: 'Qible ki taraf pakhane ya peshab ke liye munh na karo aur na peeth karo, lekin mashriq ya maghrib ki taraf karo.'"
"86","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo pakhana jae woh parda kare.' Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya."
"87","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab pakhane se bahar aate to farmate: 'Teri bakhshish [mangta hun].' Ise Khamsa ne riwayat kiya aur Abu Hatim aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"88","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Mas'ud (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) pakhane gae to mujhe hukm diya ke teen pathar laun, to mujhe do pathar mile aur teesra na mila, to main ek gobar le aaya, to Aap ne dono ko le liya aur gobar phenk diya aur farmaya: 'Yeh gandagi hai.' Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya; Ahmad aur Daraqutni ne izafa kiya: 'Mere paas is ke siwa lao.'"
"89","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne haddi ya gobar se istinja karne se mana farmaya aur farmaya: 'Yeh dono pak nahin karte.' Ise Daraqutni ne riwayat kiya aur ise sahih kaha."
"90","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Peshab se bacho, kyunke qabr ka aksar azab isi se hai.' Ise Daraqutni ne riwayat kiya; aur Hakim ke han hai: 'Qabr ka aksar azab peshab se hai.' Aur woh sahih sanad wali hai."
"91","[AI-translation] Hazrat Suraqah bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke hamen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne baitul-khala mein sikhaya ke ham baen par baithen aur dayan khadi rakhen. Ise Baihaqi ne za'if sanad se riwayat kiya."
"92","[AI-translation] Hazrat Isa bin Yazdad apne walid se riwayat karte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab tum mein se koi peshab kare to apni sharmgah ko teen martaba jhatke.' Ise Ibn Majah ne za'if sanad se riwayat kiya."
"93","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ahle Quba se poocha to unhon ne kaha: Ham pathron ke sath pani milate hain. Ise Bazzar ne za'if sanad se riwayat kiya; aur is ki asl Abu Dawud aur Tirmidhi mein hai aur Ibn Khuzaimah (Rahimahullah) ne ise Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) ki hadees se pathron ke zikr ke baghair sahih kaha."
"94","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Pani pani se hai [yani ghusl mani nikalne se wajib hota hai].' Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya; aur is ki asl Bukhari mein hai."
"95","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab [mard] aurat ki chaar shakhan [hathon aur pairon] ke darmiyan baithe phir us se koshish kare to ghusl wajib ho gaya.' Muttafaq alaih; Muslim ne izafa kiya: 'Agarche mani na nikle.'"
"96","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Salamah se riwayat hai ke Umm Sulaim jo Abu Talhah ki biwi thin ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak Allah haq se haya nahin karta, to kya aurat par ghusl hai jab use ehtelam ho? Aap ne farmaya: 'Han, jab woh pani dekhe.' Al-hadees. Muttafaq alaih."
"97","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us aurat ke bare mein farmaya jo khwab mein woh dekhe jo mard dekhta hai: 'Woh ghusl kare.' Muttafaq alaih; Muslim ne izafa kiya: To Umm Sulaim ne kaha: Kya aisa hota hai? Aap ne farmaya: 'Han, phir mushabahat kahan se hoti hai?'"
"98","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) chaar cheezon se ghusl farmate the: janabat se, juma ke din, pichhne lagwane se aur maiyyat ko ghusl dene se. Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya aur Ibn Khuzaimah (Rahimahullah) ne ise sahih kaha."
"99","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Sumamah bin Usal ke qisse mein riwayat hai jab woh Musalman hue aur Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen ghusl karne ka hukm diya. Ise Abdur Razzaq ne riwayat kiya; aur is ki asl muttafaq alaih hai."
"100","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Juma ka ghusl har baligh par wajib hai.' Ise Sab'a ne riwayat kiya."
"101","[AI-translation] Hazrat Samurah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo juma ke din wuzu kare to yahi kafi aur achcha hai, aur jo ghusl kare to ghusl afzal hai.' Ise Khamsa ne riwayat kiya aur Tirmidhi ne ise hasan kaha."
"102","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamen Quran padhate jab tak junubi na hote. Ise Khamsa ne riwayat kiya, aur yeh lafz Tirmidhi ka hai aur unhon ne ise hasan kaha, aur Ibn Hibban (Rahimahullah) ne ise sahih kaha."
"103","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab tum mein se koi apni biwi ke paas aae phir dobara aana chahe to dono ke darmiyan wuzu kare.' Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya; Hakim ne izafa kiya: 'Kyunke yeh dobara aane ke liye ziyada nashath bakhsh hai.' Aur Arba'a ke han Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) junubi haalat mein sote baghair is ke ke pani ko chhute; aur yeh ma'lul hai."
"104","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab janabat se ghusl farmate to shuru mein dono hath dhote, phir dayen se baen par pani dalte aur sharmgah dhote, phir wuzu farmate, phir pani lete aur unglion ko balon ki jadon mein dakhil karte, phir sar par teen lapen dalte, phir baqi jism par pani bahate, phir dono paon dhote. Muttafaq alaih, aur alfaz Muslim ke hain; aur un donon ke han Maimunah ki hadees mein hai: Phir Aap ne apni sharmgah par pani dala aur use baen hath se dhoya, phir use zameen par ragra; aur ek riwayat mein hai: To use mitti se poncha; aur us ke aakhir mein hai: Phir main Aap ke paas rumal lai to Aap ne use wapas kar diya, aur is mein hai: Aur Aap apne hath se pani jhadne lage."
"105","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Salamah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Main ek aisi aurat hun jo apne sar ke bal mazboot bandhti hun, kya main unhen janabat ke ghusl ke liye kholun? Aur ek riwayat mein hai: Aur haiz ke liye? To Aap ne farmaya: 'Nahin, tumhen yahi kafi hai ke apne sar par teen lapen dalo.' Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"106","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Main masjid ko haiza aur junubi ke liye halal nahin karta.' Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya aur Ibn Khuzaimah (Rahimahullah) ne ise sahih kaha."
"107","[AI-translation] Unhin se riwayat hai ke main aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ek hi bartan se ghusl karte, janabat ki haalat mein hamare hath us mein mukhtalif hote. Muttafaq alaih; Ibn Hibban ne izafa kiya: Aur hamare hath mil jate."
"108","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Har baal ke neeche janabat hai, to balon ko dho aur khal ko saaf karo.' Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmidhi ne riwayat kiya aur donon ne ise za'if kaha; aur Ahmad ke han Aishah se isi tarah hai aur is mein ek majhool rawi hai."
"109","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Mujhe paanch cheezen di gayin jo mujh se pahle kisi ko nahin di gayin: Ek mahine ki musafat se rob se meri madad ki gayi, aur mere liye zameen masjid aur pak karne wali banai gayi, to jo bhi aadmi namaz ka waqt pae woh namaz padhe.' Aur hadees zikr ki. Aur Muslim ke han Huzaifah ki hadees mein hai: 'Aur us ki mitti hamare liye pak karne wali banai gayi jab ham pani na paen.' Aur Ahmad ke han Ali se hai: 'Aur mitti mere liye pak karne wali banai gayi.'"
"110","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ammar bin Yasir (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke mujhe Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek hajat mein bheja, to main junubi ho gaya aur pani na paya, to main mitti mein loat pot hua jaise janwar lot-ta hai, phir main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur Aap se is ka zikr kiya, to Aap ne farmaya: 'Tumhen yahi kafi tha ke apne hathon se aisa kehte,' phir Aap ne dono hathon se zameen par ek martaba mara, phir baen ko dayen par aur dono hathlion ke zahir aur chehre par phera. Muttafaq alaih, aur alfaz Muslim ke hain; aur Bukhari ki ek riwayat mein hai: Aur Aap ne dono hathlion se zameen par mara aur un mein phoonka, phir un se apne chehre aur hathlion ka masah kiya."
"111","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Tayammum do zarben hain: ek zarb chehre ke liye aur ek zarb kuhnion tak hathon ke liye.' Ise Daraqutni ne riwayat kiya aur aimma ne is ke mauqoof hone ko sahih kaha."
"112","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Mitti Musalman ka wuzu hai agarche das saal pani na pae, phir jab pani pae to Allah se dare aur use apni khal se lagae.' Ise Bazzar ne riwayat kiya aur Ibn Qattan ne ise sahih kaha, lekin Daraqutni ne is ke mursal hone ko sahih kaha; aur Tirmidhi ke han Abu Zarr se isi tarah hai aur Tirmidhi ne ise sahih kaha, aur Hakim ne bhi."
"113","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke do aadmi safar mein nikle, to namaz ka waqt aaya jabke un ke paas pani na tha, to donon ne pak mitti se tayammum kiya aur namaz padhi, phir unhen waqt ke andar pani mil gaya, to ek ne namaz aur wuzu dohraya aur doosre ne na dohraya, phir donon Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae aur Aap se is ka zikr kiya, to Aap ne us se farmaya jis ne na dohraya tha: 'Tum ne sunnat ko paya aur tumhari namaz tumhen kafi ho gayi,' aur doosre se farmaya: 'Tumhare liye dohra ajr hai.' Ise Abu Dawud aur Nasai ne riwayat kiya."
"114","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Allah Azza wa Jalla ke qaul 'Aur agar tum beemar ho ya safar par' ke bare mein riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Jab aadmi ko Allah ke raste mein zakhm aur phode hon, phir woh junubi ho jae aur use khauf ho ke agar ghusl karega to mar jaega to tayammum kare. Ise Daraqutni ne mauqoof riwayat kiya, aur Bazzar ne ise marfoo' kiya, aur Ibn Khuzaimah aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha."
"115","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke meri kalaiyon mein se ek toot gayi to main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha to Aap ne mujhe pattion par masah karne ka hukm diya. Ise Ibn Majah ne bahut hi kamzor sanad se riwayat kiya."
"116","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) se us aadmi ke bare mein riwayat hai jo zakhmi hua phir us ne ghusl kiya to mar gaya: 'Use yahi kafi tha ke tayammum karta aur apne zakhm par kapda bandhta, phir us par masah karta aur baqi jism dhota.' Ise Abu Dawud ne aisi sanad se riwayat kiya jis mein za'f hai aur is ke rawiyon par ikhtilaf hai."
"117","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke sunnat mein se hai ke aadmi ek tayammum se siwae ek namaz ke na padhe, phir doosri namaz ke liye tayammum kare. Ise Daraqutni ne bahut hi za'if sanad se riwayat kiya."
"118","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Fatimah bint Abi Hubaish ko istihaza aata tha, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Haiz ka khoon siyah khoon hai jo pahchana jata hai, to jab woh ho to namaz se ruk jao, aur jab doosra ho to wuzu karo aur namaz padho.' Ise Abu Dawud aur Nasai ne riwayat kiya aur Ibn Hibban aur Hakim ne ise sahih kaha, aur Abu Hatim ne ise munkar kaha. Aur Abu Dawud ke han Asma bint Umais ki hadees mein hai: Woh ek lagan mein baithe, phir jab pani ke upar zardi dekhe to zuhr aur asr ke liye ek ghusl kare, aur maghrib aur isha ke liye ek ghusl kare, aur fajr ke liye ghusl kare, aur is ke darmiyan wuzu kare."
"119","[AI-translation] Hazrat Hamnah bint Jahsh se riwayat hai ke mujhe bahut bada shadeed istihaza aata tha, to main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas fatwa lene aai, to Aap ne farmaya: 'Yeh to shaitan ki ek thokar hai, to chhe ya saat din haiz mein raho, phir ghusl karo, phir jab poori tarah pak ho jao to chaubees ya taees din namaz padho, aur roza rakho aur namaz padho, kyunke yeh tumhen kafi hai, aur isi tarah karo jaise aurtain haiz mein karti hain, phir agar tum taqat rakho ke zuhr ko moakhar karo aur asr ko jaldi karo, phir jab pak ho jao to ghusl karke zuhr aur asr dono padho, phir maghrib ko moakhar karo aur isha ko jaldi karo, phir ghusl karke dono namazon ko jama karo to aisa karo; aur subah ke sath ghusl karo aur namaz padho.' Aap ne farmaya: 'Aur yeh mere nazdeek donon baton mein se ziyada pasandeeda hai.' Ise Khamsa ne Nasai ke siwa riwayat kiya, aur Tirmidhi ne ise sahih kaha aur Bukhari ne ise hasan kaha."
"120","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Umm Habibah bint Jahsh ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se khoon ki shikayat ki to Aap ne farmaya: 'Utni muddat thehro jitni tumhara haiz tumhen rokta tha, phir ghusl karo,' phir woh har namaz ke liye ghusl karti thin. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya; aur Bukhari ki ek riwayat mein hai: 'Aur har namaz ke liye wuzu karo.' Aur yeh Abu Dawud aur ghair ke han doosri wajh se hai."
"121","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Atiyyah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke ham tuhr ke baad gandlepan aur zardi ko kuch na samajhte the. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kiya aur Abu Dawud ne, aur alfaz Abu Dawud ke hain."
"122","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Yahud jab aurat haiza hoti to us ke sath khana na khate, to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Har kaam karo siwae nikah [jima'] ke.' Ise Muslim ne riwayat kiya."
"123","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mujhe hukm dete to main tahband bandhti, phir Aap mujh se mubashirat farmate jabke main haiza hoti. Muttafaq alaih."
"124","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se us shakhs ke bare mein riwayat hai jo apni biwi ke paas haiz ki haalat mein aae: 'Woh ek dinar ya aadha dinar sadqa kare.' Ise Khamsa ne riwayat kiya aur Hakim aur Ibn Qattan ne ise sahih kaha, aur un ke siwa ne is ke mauqoof hone ko tarjeeh di."
"125","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Kya aisa nahin ke jab woh haiza hoti hai to namaz padhti hai na roza rakhti hai?' Muttafaq alaih, ek taweel hadees mein."
"126","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke jab ham Sarif pahunche to mujhe haiz aa gaya, to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Woh karo jo haji karta hai siwae is ke ke Baitullah ka tawaf na karo yahan tak ke pak ho jao.' Muttafaq alaih, ek taweel hadees mein."
"127","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mu'az (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha: Mard ke liye apni biwi se haiz ki haalat mein kya halal hai? Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo tahband ke upar hai.' Ise Abu Dawud ne riwayat kiya aur ise za'if kaha."
"128","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Salamah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke nifas wali aurtain Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein apne nifas ke baad chalis din baithti thin. Ise Khamsa ne Nasai ke siwa riwayat kiya aur alfaz Abu Dawud ke hain; aur unhi ke ek lafz mein hai: Aur Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen nifas ki namaz ki qaza ka hukm na diya; aur Hakim (Rahimahullah) ne ise sahih kaha."
